  "post_title": "Ana Gargallo Porcar será la reina de la Fira d'Onda 2014",
  "post_date": "2014-07-07 19:42:54",
  "post_name": "ana-gargallo-porcar-sera-la-reina-de-la-fira-donda-2014",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La suerte ha querido que Ana Gargallo Porcar, representante de las Fiestas del Arrabal del Castillo, sea la reina de la Fira d&#39;Onda 2014, al extraer su nombre del saco del sorteo la todav&iacute;a reina Mary Pradas &Aacute;lvaro, en el transcurso del Pleno extraordinario del Ayuntamiento celebrado la tarde de este lunes en el Sal&oacute;n de Sesiones municipal.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_9231.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Ana Gargallo Porcar tiene 23 a&ntilde;os y est&aacute; estudianto el grado de Administraci&oacute;n de Empresas en la Universitat Jaume I (UJI). La acompa&ntilde;ar&aacute;n en la corte de honor Luc&iacute;a Aibar Sol, por parte de l&#39;Associaci&oacute; de Cadafals i Caixons en Festes, y Eva Navarro Mora, que representa a la Colla Gegantera Sant Roc.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_9205.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La proclamaci&oacute;n este viernes 11 de julio por la noche de Ana Gargallo Porcar como reina de la fiestas del Arrabal del Castillo tendr&aacute;, pues, un sentido especial, al ser el preludio de su presentaci&oacute;n oficial como reina de la Fira d&#39;Onda 2014, en el Teatro M&oacute;naco, el s&aacute;bado 11 de octubre, justo tres meses despu&eacute;s.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraond14/img_9169.jpg\" alt=\"img_9169\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraond14/img_9170.jpg\" alt=\"img_9170\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraond14/img_9171.jpg\" alt=\"img_9171\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraond14/img_9172.jpg\" alt=\"img_9172\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraond14/img_9173.jpg\" alt=\"img_9173\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraond14/img_9174.jpg\" alt=\"img_9174\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraond14/img_9175.jpg\" alt=\"img_9175\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraond14/img_9178.jpg\" alt=\"img_9178\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraond14/img_9180.jpg\" alt=\"img_9180\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraond14/img_9183.jpg\" alt=\"img_9183\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraond14/img_9184.jpg\" alt=\"img_9184\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraond14/img_9185.jpg\" alt=\"img_9185\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraond14/img_9187.jpg\" alt=\"img_9187\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraond14/img_9189.jpg\" alt=\"img_9189\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\